{
 "duration": 49.375,
 "chunks": [
  {
   "text": "Right now, two hundred and twelve feet under the Gulf of Mexico,",
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 4.335
  },
  {
   "text": "lies an aircraft carrier.",
   "start": 4.415,
   "end": 5.952
  },
  {
   "text": "No enemy sank her.",
   "start": 6.402,
   "end": 7.719
  },
  {
   "text": "The United States Navy did.",
   "start": 8.019,
   "end": 9.807
  },
  {
   "text": "On purpose.",
   "start": 10.057,
   "end": 10.982
  },
  {
   "text": "Navy demolition divers set off twenty-two charges inside the USS Oriskany.",
   "start": 11.582,
   "end": 17.667
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty-seven minutes later,",
   "start": 18.217,
   "end": 19.753
  },
  {
   "text": "she was gone.",
   "start": 19.853,
   "end": 20.771
  },
  {
   "text": "Getting her ready to sink took over three years",
   "start": 21.271,
   "end": 23.758
  },
  {
   "text": "and about twenty million dollars.",
   "start": 23.838,
   "end": 25.597
  },
  {
   "text": "So why pay millions to put a carrier on the sea floor?",
   "start": 26.097,
   "end": 29.345
  },
  {
   "text": "Why not keep her?",
   "start": 29.695,
   "end": 30.856
  },
  {
   "text": "Why not scrap her?",
   "start": 31.056,
   "end": 32.29
  },
  {
   "text": "The answer is buried in her past.",
   "start": 32.79,
   "end": 34.659
  },
  {
   "text": "And in what was still inside her when she sank.",
   "start": 34.959,
   "end": 37.336
  },
  {
   "text": "And it matters right now.",
   "start": 37.836,
   "end": 39.195
  },
  {
   "text": "On November twelfth, the ocean liner SS United States is scheduled to follow her down.",
   "start": 39.595,
   "end": 45.695
  },
  {
   "text": "About thirteen nautical miles away.",
   "start": 45.895,
   "end": 48.175
  }
 ]
}